 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Roughly one inch per hour is about right. More than that and you risk a heavy stop, less and you might run dry. Try to take a small bottle every now and then instead of just one big fill at the start. It's lot easier. If you' going on several days, yeah. A bar of chocolate or some bagels and cheese can keep you going. A sandwich bag is also good for sandwiches. You can, but it' not healthy, and it's easy to miss mornings on rides of any length. A bag of mixed beans and some bread spread is your friend.",
